    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Draft.** Defines the content-light observation dataset layer for ranking cloud providers and local models across real Rig Relay workflows.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Purpose",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rig Relay uses cleaned, aggregated usage data to answer:",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "> For this task, on this machine, with this budget/privacy preference, > which cloud provider or local model should Rig Relay use?",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The model observation dataset is the raw material for this recommendation engine. It is content-light, consent-gated, and export-safe.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
